The MIT license above covers the code and the int8 model weights. The
following parts carry their own terms:

* Gloss column of weights/engram.bin
  Chinese glosses are adapted from CC-CEDICT, (c) CC-CEDICT contributors / MDBG,
  licensed under Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International
  (CC BY-SA 4.0), https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/ .
  English glosses are adapted from Open English WordNet, (c) the Open English
  WordNet team (derived from Princeton WordNet 3.1), licensed under Creative
  Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0),
  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/ .
  The gloss column is a derivative of these dictionaries and is distributed
  under CC BY-SA 4.0.

* weights/booksum-story-graph.idx
  Entities and event glosses are derived from BookSum (Kryscinski et al.,
  2021; kmfoda/booksum), whose chapter summaries come from study-guide sites.
  Check BookSum's terms before redistributing this file.

* firmware/host_stubs/ and the firmware integration of firmware/ConceptEngine.*
  come from a fork of the CrossPoint Reader firmware:
  Copyright (c) 2025 CrossPoint Reader organization, MIT License.

* firmware/FrameChangeMetrics.h
  Copyright (c) 2026 FreeInk, MIT License.
